  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regulatory Strengthening and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana Power Compact - Regulatory Strengthening and Capacity Building Project: The $5 million project aims to improve the regulatory monitoring and independent verification of sector performance and improve the tariff review process by supporting studies that will provide critical inputs to the redesign of the tariff structure.</narrative>
  </description>
